<p>Hello <%= @user.name %>,</p>
<p>Welcome to TG Homes, and thank you for joining us. We're glad you're here.</p>
<% if @confirm_url %>
<p>One step first: confirm this is your email address so you can sign in. The link works for 3 days.</p>
<p><a href="<%= @confirm_url %>">Confirm my email</a></p>
<% end %>
<p>With your account you can:</p>
<ul>
  <li>book a stay at our homes and pay by M-Pesa or card</li>
  <li>save homes you like for later</li>
  <li>message us about a home or your stay, and send any files we need</li>
  <li>see your bookings, receipts and check-in details in one place</li>
</ul>
<p><a href="<%= @homes_url %>">Browse the homes</a> or <a href="<%= @account_url %>">open your account</a>.</p>
<p>Warm regards,<br>TG Homes</p>
<% if @confirm_url %>
<p style="color:#666;font-size:13px">If you didn't make an account, ignore this email.</p>
<% end %>
